DesmosPlus BigList integration

Upstream projects:
https://github.com/whitecaplol/DesmosBigList
https://github.com/whitecaplol/DesAudify

The matrix-backed formatter is adapted from format_desmos_list in
DesAudify/desaudify_cli.py, commit 4ddd49a65851701615f5ec01c0c901516fa23433,
licensed under Apache License 2.0. See DESAUDIFY-LICENSE.

Changes: JavaScript port; validated numeric input; bounded matrix fragments;
correct local offsets across fragments; a non-matrix compatibility backend
for older bundled calculators; in-page list controls; browser audio integration.

BigList provides a callable representation, not an increase to Desmos's native
list limit. A single returned list still cannot exceed the calculator's limit.
